3. Fitzpatrick skin type 1, 2, 5, or 6 (pre-screening);
4. Melanin Index (MI) \ 350 as measured on the inner arm;
5. One of the following conditions, based on past 3 months' history or screening electrocardiogram:

1. Normal sinus rhythm;
2. Persistent or permanent or onset atrial fibrillation;
