10. Patients with skin infectious diseases;
11. Patients with a history of mental illness or cognitive impairment;
12. Patients who have participated in other clinical trials that may affect this trial within the past 30 days;
13. Concomitant medication that might interfere with study results;
14. Other situations where the researchers consider it inappropriate for a patient to take part in the trial.

Inclusion Criteria:

* first onset, mono-hemispheric ischemic stroke in the middle cerebral artery territory;
